m/EIAgov/status/2118349107467010119"}, {"author_id": "17468569", "created_at": "2026-11-05T14:24:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118348643069534253"], "id": "2118348643069534253", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 80, "impression_count": 123455, "like_count": 1808, "quote_count": 15, "reply_count": 157, "retweet_count": 29}, "text": "The first thing I do when arriving at a hotel is make my room as cold as it can get.", "url": "https://x.com/bryan_johnson/status/2118348643069534253"}, {"author_id": "84679163", "created_at": "2026-11-05T14:15:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118346421522833876"], "id": "2118346421522833876", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 2015, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Amid the global energy crisis, the Middle East &amp; North Africa faces its own shock, as import bills soar, some producers lose export revenues &amp; vulnerable countries struggle for fuel &amp; power.\n\nMore on how this is redefining energy security in the region 👉 https://t.co/DUmDlRcXV0 https://t.co/VnUUyq556j", "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "How the energy crisis is redefining energy security in the Middle East and North Africa - A commentary by Nadim Abillama, Matthew Van der Beeuren", "display_url": "iea.li/4zur0Mw", "end": 290, "expanded_url": "https://iea.li/4zur0Mw", "images": [{"height": 1200, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117653566487744512/Slp90zNk?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117653566487744512/Slp90zNk?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 267, "status": 200, "title": "How the energy crisis is redefining energy security in the Middle East and North Africa - IEA", "unwound_url": "https://www.iea.org/commentaries/how-the-energy-crisis-is-redefining-energy-security-in-the-middle-east-and-north-africa?utm_content=bufferf1c5c&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter.com&utm_campaign=buffer", "url": "https://t.co/DUmDlRcXV0"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/VnUUyq556j", "end": 314, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2118346421522833876/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118346418909745152", "start": 291, "url": "https://t.co/VnUUyq556j"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2118346421522833876"}, {"author_id": "84679163", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:35:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118321192348037554"], "id": "2118321192348037554", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 2623, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "Renewables 2026 comes out tomorrow!\n \nIt offers the latest global analysis &amp; forecasts for hydropower, solar, wind, geothermal, biofuels &amp; more – and looks at how the Hormuz crisis could impact their growth trends.\n \nWatch the LIVE launch from 10:30 CET 👉 https://t.co/A4hqfks328 https://t.co/1QbYffBUGo", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "iea.li/4BJcLoN", "end": 287, "expanded_url": "https://iea.li/4BJcLoN", "start": 264, "status": 403, "unwound_url": "https://www.iea.org/events/renewables-2026?utm_content=bufferc2712&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter.com&utm_campaign=buffer", "url": "https://t.co/A4hqfks328"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/1QbYffBUGo", "end": 311, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2118321192348037554/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118321190074798080", "start": 288, "url": "https://t.co/1QbYffBUGo"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2118321192348037554"}, {"author_id": "19386622", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118312388382593149"], "id": "2118312388382593149", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 3145, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "📣 The 6th IAEA International Conference on Nuclear Power Plant Life Management (#PLiM 6) will take place from 7-11 December 2026 in Tokyo 🇯🇵\n\nThis conference will focus on innovative solutions and strategic plant life management for long-term operation, to ensure sustainability, https://t.co/m7C3VUYZEp", "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 85, "start": 80, "tag": "PLiM"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/m7C3VUYZEp", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/iaeaorg/status/2118312388382593149/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118279997076975616", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/m7C3VUYZEp"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/iaeaorg/status/2118312388382593149"}, {"author_id": "16933019", "created_at": "2026-11-05T09:13:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118270462664835501"], "id": "2118270462664835501", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 254, "impression_count": 60818, "like_count": 1153, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 98}, "text": "One of the truest and funniest takes on the midterm elections! https://t.co/GzNbTUedwp", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/traecrowder/st…", "end": 86, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/traecrowder/status/2118113959157072216", "start": 63, "url": "https://t.co/GzNbTUedwp"}]}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118113959157072216", "type": "quoted"}], "url": "https://x.com/AukeHoekstra/status/2118270462664835501"}, {"author_id": "84679163", "created_at": "2026-11-05T09:02:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118267816302215341"], "id": "2118267816302215341", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 3186, "like_count": 29, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "We just released our new review of Spain’s energy policies\n\nIt shows renewables are strengthening 🇪🇸’s energy security &amp; competitiveness – but faster electrification, grid modernisation &amp; greater flexibility can extend these gains across the economy\n\nMore: https://t.co/MQBaSV4zPA https://t.co/MUKgZehkdC", "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Spain 2026 - Analysis and key findings. A report by the International Energy Agency.", "display_url": "iea.li/48zTDMw", "end": 288, "